statement error (percentile value 1\.5 is not between 0 and 1|PERCENTILEs can only take parameters in the range \[0, 1\])
SELECT percentile_cont(1.5) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY x) FROM (VALUES (1), (2)) t(x)


